        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Cover (palampore) of European linen and cotton twill embroidered with silks in fine chain stitch. Five central blue and red swirling floral designs emerge from a decorative base vase situated upon a pale cream cotton cloth. Individual floral motifs and foliage create a rich border which surrounds the central square."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/22995cb8-d690-316e-8db5-81cd6439add8> .

